                <mxCell id="constraints" value="&lt;b&gt;Ограничения схемы&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;meetings: capacity &amp;gt; 0; end_at &amp;gt; start_at&lt;br&gt;events: end_at &amp;gt; start_at; указана хотя бы одна комната&lt;br&gt;commentaries: 1 ≤ mark ≤ 10&lt;br&gt;offline_rooms: UNIQUE (address, place)&lt;br&gt;registrations: PK (member_id, meeting_id)&lt;br&gt;comment_id не UNIQUE: один отзыв может иметь несколько ссылок&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;ON DELETE: родитель → потомок&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;members → registrations: CASCADE&lt;br&gt;meetings → registrations, events: CASCADE&lt;br&gt;creators → meetings: RESTRICT&lt;br&gt;online_rooms, offline_rooms → events: RESTRICT&lt;br&gt;commentaries → registrations: NO ACTION" parent="1" vertex="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=22;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=17;fontColor=#475569;">
